WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.291 --> 00:00:02.169
Mommy! Mommy!

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:03.044
A Super Hero!

00:00:03.911 --> 00:00:05.625
Wow, Stevie.
You wanna say hi?

00:00:08.602 --> 00:00:09.291
&lt;i&gt;Come on, kid.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:10.047 --> 00:00:10.833
&lt;i&gt;Puny tourist.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:11.755 --> 00:00:12.916
&lt;i&gt;Hey, look. That one's you. &lt;/i&gt;

00:00:12.916 --> 00:00:15.291
No, that's Katniss Everdeen.
Let's go.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.875
Your problem is branding.

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:19.208
No, my problem is you.

00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:20.958
&lt;i&gt;And this ninja suit&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:20.958 --> 00:00:22.125
and that people
are trying to kill you

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:23.125
because of this
ninja suit.

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.916
The whole thing's a problem
that I'm going to solve today

00:00:25.916 --> 00:00:27.083
so I can go home
to my family.

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:28.666
No, it's branding.

00:00:33.111 --> 00:00:34.111
 

